{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794847800595,"sessionID":"ses_e1abf3e72ffecbrpVf6MWZonWP","part":{"partID":"prt_1e543bf65002gVf0sB7qpze4iV","sessionID":"ses_e1abf3e72ffecbrpVf6MWZonWP","messageID":"msg_1e543b444001l8lJWP5eIpMGmc","type":"tool","id":"call_f26612633b6046b5bdc52fdf","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Deep Review Strategy - attach-scorer-10\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\nPass-ten fan-out lineage for the `attach-scorer` area. Reviews the mention guard that\nnow drops inline-code, bold and quote marks before it reads a refusal or question lead\n(`commandOnlyMentioned`), the shared scratch-folder pattern in the transcript scorer\n(`insideCheckout`'s no-checkout fallback and `guardedWriteCounts`), the re-captured\nrouting baseline where two slash-variant rows moved from offered to withheld, and the\nbench's Vibe row.\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nReview: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build (lineage attach-scorer-10, pass 10)\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- The `docs-merge` area: README.md, SKILL.md, changelog/v1.1.0.0.md, .env.example and the\n  merge-resolved `sk-doc`, doctor-install-presentation, changelog and route-slice files.\n- Rescoring stored sets, changing thresholds, weights or corpus rows.\n- Reading holdout or prompt corpora; printing session text from a CLI session store.\n- Changing code under review. This lineage reports findings only.\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Convergence at the configured threshold (0.10) once every dimension is covered.\n- `maxIterations` 8.\n- Any active P0 stops a PASS verdict regardless of convergence.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n## 4. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n[None yet -- the reducer fills this table as each iteration records a dimension]\n\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n| - | - | - | - |\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 5. RUNNING FINDINGS\n- P0 (Blockers): 0\n- P1 (Required): 0\n- P2 (Suggestions): 0\n- Resolved: 0\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n- [First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n- [First iteration -- populated as each iteration records a failed approach]\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n[Populated when a review approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n- [Populated as iterations rule directions out]\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n- Dimension: correctness\n- Focus: the four changed surfaces named by `review-brief-10.txt`\n- Reason: pass ten opens with the correctness dimension\n- Rotation status: D1-D4 pending\n- Required evidence: every finding names a concrete input and a `file:line`\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- Target pointers: `command-attach.ts` (mention guard at 409-451, use at 259 and 501),\n  `score-command-transcripts.mjs` (commandParts 610-640, insideCheckout 716-742,\n  selfChosenAuto 1450-1470, guardedWriteCounts 1520-1545), `command-routing-baseline.json`\n  (slash_variant rows sv-06 and sv-08), `README.md` cell for the capture script, and\n  `bench/hook-brief-signal-noise.bench.ts` (SEVEN_AXIS_MATRIX).\n- Behavior claims: an offer reads a refusal or question about a command as a mention\n  even when the name is backticked, bolded or quoted; the scratch-folder pattern is\n  shared by the no-checkout fallback and the guarded-write check; the re-captured\n  baseline withholds two slash-variant rows because both ask a question; the bench\n  matrix enumerates every advisor runtime.\n- Reuse and conventions: `MODE_SUFFIX` was a single regex before, now `WITH_MODIFIER`\n  and `SUFFIX_WORD` are shared by `commandParts`, `SELF_AUTO` and `selfChosenAuto`.\n- Review risks and gaps: no `resource-map.md` in the packet; the baseline's two moved\n  rows are judged only by `lead-diag.mjs` lead indices per the recorded limit; no\n  holdout or prompt-corpus read is permitted.\n\n---\n\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | - |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | - |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | notApplicable | - | Target is runtime code, not a skill contract |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No agent definition changed |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No catalog row names these files |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No playbook claim covers the area |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` | - | - | 0 | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` | - | - | 0 | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs` | - | - | 0 | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts` | - | - | 0 | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-routing-baseline.json` | - | - | 0 | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md` | - | - | 0 | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/bench/hook-brief-signal-noise.bench.ts` | - | - | 0 | pending |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Max iterations: 8\n- Convergence threshold: 0.10\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-attach-scorer-10-1794847584683-k2l24m, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\n- Per-iteration budget: 24 tool calls, 10 minutes\n- Severity threshold: P2\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\n- Started: 2026-11-16T16:49:26.000Z\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-scorer-10/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-scorer-10/deep-review-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-scorer-10/deep-review-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"# Deep Review Strategy - attach-scorer-10\\n\\n## 1. OVERVIEW\\n\\nPass-ten fan-out lineage for the `attach-scorer` area. Reviews the mention guard that\\nnow drops inline-code, bold and quote marks before it reads a refusal or question lead\\n(`commandOnlyMentioned`), the shared scratch-folder pattern in the transcript scorer\\n(`insideCheckout`'s no-checkout fallback and `guardedWriteCounts`), the re-captured\\nrouting baseline where two slash-variant rows moved from offered to withheld, and the\\nbench's Vibe row.\\n\\n## 2. TOPIC\\n\\nReview: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build (lineage attach-scorer-10, pass 10)\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\\n## 4. NON-GOALS\\n\\n- The `docs-merge` area: README.md, SKILL.md, changelog/v1.1.0.0.md, .env.example and the\\n  merge-resolved `sk-doc`, doctor-install-presentation, changelog and route-slice files.\\n- Rescoring stored sets, changing thresholds, weights or corpus rows.\\n- Reading holdout or prompt corpora; printing session text from a CLI session store.\\n- Changing code under review. This lineage reports findings only.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\\n\\n- Convergence at the configured threshold (0.10) once every dimension is covered.\\n- `maxIterations` 8.\\n- Any active P0 stops a PASS verdict regardless of convergence.\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\\n## 4. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\\n[None yet -- the reducer fills this table as each iteration records a dimension]\\n\\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\\n| - | - | - | - |\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\\n<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\\n## 5. RUNNING FINDINGS\\n- P0 (Blockers): 0\\n- P1 (Required): 0\\n- P2 (Suggestions): 0\\n- Resolved: 0\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n\\n- [First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n- [First iteration -- populated as each iteration records a failed approach]\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\\n## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\\n[Populated when a review approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\\n- Completed pivots: 0\\n- Failed pivots: 0\\n- Audited overrides: 0\\n- Swept: none yet\\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\\n\\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\\n\\n- [Populated as iterations rule directions out]\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\\n- Dimension: correctness\\n- Focus: the four changed surfaces named by `review-brief-10.txt`\\n- Reason: pass ten opens with the correctness dimension\\n- Rotation status: D1-D4 pending\\n- Required evidence: every finding names a concrete input and a `file:line`\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\\n\\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\\n\\n- Target pointers: `command-attach.ts` (mention guard at 409-451, use at 259 and 501),\\n  `score-command-transcripts.mjs` (commandParts 610-640, insideCheckout 716-742,\\n  selfChosenAuto 1450-1470, guardedWriteCounts 1520-1545), `command-routing-baseline.json`\\n  (slash_variant rows sv-06 and sv-08), `README.md` cell for the capture script, and\\n  `bench/hook-brief-signal-noise.bench.ts` (SEVEN_AXIS_MATRIX).\\n- Behavior claims: an offer reads a refusal or question about a command as a mention\\n  even when the name is backticked, bolded or quoted; the scratch-folder pattern is\\n  shared by the no-checkout fallback and the guarded-write check; the re-captured\\n  baseline withholds two slash-variant rows because both ask a question; the bench\\n  matrix enumerates every advisor runtime.\\n- Reuse and conventions: `MODE_SUFFIX` was a single regex before, now `WITH_MODIFIER`\\n  and `SUFFIX_WORD` are shared by `commandParts`, `SELF_AUTO` and `selfChosenAuto`.\\n- Review risks and gaps: no `resource-map.md` in the packet; the baseline's two moved\\n  rows are judged only by `lead-diag.mjs` lead indices per the recorded limit; no\\n  holdout or prompt-corpus read is permitted.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | - |\\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | - |\\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | notApplicable | - | Target is runtime code, not a skill contract |\\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No agent definition changed |\\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No catalog row names these files |\\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No playbook claim covers the area |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` | - | - | 0 | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` | - | - | 0 | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs` | - | - | 0 | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts` | - | - | 0 | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-routing-baseline.json` | - | - | 0 | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md` | - | - | 0 | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/bench/hook-brief-signal-noise.bench.ts` | - | - | 0 | pending |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Max iterations: 8\\n- Convergence threshold: 0.10\\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-attach-scorer-10-1794847584683-k2l24m, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\\n- Per-iteration budget: 24 tool calls, 10 minutes\\n- Severity threshold: P2\\n- Review target type: spec-folder\\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\\n- Started: 2026-11-16T16:49:26.000Z\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/attach-scorer-10/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794847784805,"end":1794847800595}}}}
