s.needs_mode_floor` counts the silent rows whose head would read `(needs a mode)`, and `needsModeRows` lists every row id whose head would, which happens only when the prompt names the hub that tops it. `attachedMetrics.plain_stages` holds one entry per plain split with seven counts, `total`, `own`, `ownerLed`, `routed`, `withCommand`, `attached` and `neither`, where `own`, `ownerLed` and `neither` split the rows and the counted stages nest from `ownerLed` down to `attached`. `attachedMetrics.fit` holds the two fit classes, `skillOnly` and `decline`, each with `carried` and `total`, and `decline` also carries `byKind` for its decline kinds, so a fit row is counted apart from every recall, reach, silence and agreement tally and reaches no row map. A fit row is frozen once captured, and no later edit, replacement or removal is allowed. Five of the eight slash-variant rows that name a command ask a question about it, two of them with the name in backticks, and a question about a command carries no command by design, so `slash_variant.reached_top3` can reach 3 of 8. |\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md:138:| `command-routing-baseline.json` | Captured command routing numbers that `tests/command-routing-slice.vitest.ts` holds the scorer to. |\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"rg -n \\\"2 of 8|10|6/10|2/8|5/9|reached_top3\\\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md | head -5; echo \\\"---GATES---\\\"; rg -n \\\"command-routing-baseline\\\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests --glob '!**/command-prompts.jsonl' --glob '!**/holdout-prompts.jsonl' --glob '!**/behaviour-fresh-prompts.jsonl' | head -20\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794848081310,"end":1794848083128}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794848083136,"sessionID":"ses_e1abf3e72ffecbrpVf6MWZonWP","part":{"partID":"prt_1e5484086001GpfdsyywFo2D8l","sessionID":"ses_e1abf3e72ffecbrpVf6MWZonWP","messageID":"msg_1e5481aa9001pNlMSJ8OjqB766","type":"tool","id":"call_6a1c1809dc344d17af33726d","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"rg -n \"slash_variant|reached_top3|agreement\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime --glob '!**/command-prompts.jsonl' --glob '!**/holdout-prompts.jsonl' --glob '!**/behaviour-fresh-prompts.jsonl' -g '*.ts' -g '*.mjs' -g '*.md' -g '*.json' | rg -v \"command-routing-baseline.json|/dist/|routing-accuracy/README.md\" | head -30","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research"},"output":".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:529:    let agreementCorrect = 0;\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:530:    let agreementTotal = 0;\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:593:      // silence or agreement count below describes it and no row map publishes\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:695:          agreementTotal += 1;\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:696:          if (idToCommand.get(laterBridgeId).skillId === ids[0]) agreementCorrect += 1;\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:744:        slash_variant: {\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:745:          reached_top3: slashReachedTop3,\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:750:        agreement: { correct: agreementCorrect, total: agreementTotal },\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/advisor-server.ts:256:// failure, a shutting-down daemon is retryable, protocol disagreement has its own\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/advisor-server.ts:285:      `advisor protocol disagreement: daemon \"${ADVISOR_PROTOCOL_VERSION}\", client ${clientVersion}`,\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/parity/local-native-divergence-ratchet.vitest.ts:12:// exists because large local-vs-native disagreement on harder prompts was\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/parity/local-native-divergence-ratchet.vitest.ts:417:  // local-vs-native disagreement is unreviewed drift and fails the gate.\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/README.md:185:+-- vocabulary-agreement.vitest.ts\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/stress-test/skill-advisor/five-lane-fusion-stress.vitest.ts:47:  it('keeps a 500+ skill corpus routable when one skill has strong lane agreement', () => {\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/parity/fixtures/local-native-approved-divergences.json:52:      \"reason\": \"baseline divergence captured 2026-06-13: local/native lexical-mis-route disagreement (local=command-create-feature-catalog, native=sk-doc)\",\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/parity/fixtures/local-native-approved-divergences.json:82:      \"reason\": \"divergence captured 2026-07-06: local/native routing disagreement (local=sk-code, native=none)\",\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/parity/fixtures/local-native-approved-divergences.json:164:      \"reason\": \"baseline divergence captured 2026-06-13: local/native lexical-mis-route disagreement (local=create:manual-testing-playbook, native=sk-doc)\",\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/parity/fixtures/local-native-approved-divergences.json:206:      \"reason\": \"local abstains after the model-alias resolv