Fixed in 038: A-1 unsafe checkout, C-01 README health records, D-01 and CRIT-4 :unattended, :with-* and chained suffixes, D-02 tests reading AI_SESSION_CHILD (suite now 2328/0 with the flag unset and set). Open with reason: BAT-02 P0 is the operator-local alignment surface-map.yaml naming .skilled/hooks/dispatch/lib, which main m... |\n366:| Alignment recheck, 20261116T111907Z | Branch-caused P0 0 and P1 0 | recheck.cjs from run 20261116T085341Z at 15d8b463396: resolved 0, still open 13, new 0, needs review 26, read by hand. D-02 is listed open because its suggested fix edited the test, while 038 cleared the inherited flag in vitest.config.ts; the suite passes 2328/0 with AI_SESSION_CHILD=1. A-1, C-01, CRIT-4 and D-01 read changed differently; each is covered by the tests 038 added and the merged-t... |\n383:| Alignment final, run 20261116T141322Z | Fixed on branch | 0 P0, 1 P1, 30 P2 over 118 commits; P1 D-01 (backticked refusal or question still attached the command) fixed in command-attach with 6 cases failing on the previous code; 8 P2 fixed, rest open with reasons in 038/scratch/alignment-final-dispositions.md |\n384:| Baseline shift, slash-variant rows | Recaptured | sv-06 and sv-08 ask about a backticked command (lead indices only, no prompt text) and now withhold it as the plain question does; reached_top3 2 to 0, agreement 6/10 to 5/9; typed recall 24/44, false offers 0/35 and holdout 2/44 unchanged |\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"rg -n \\\"quote|backtick|markup|and/or|single\\\" specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/implementation-summary.md | head -15; echo \\\"---GOAL ROW---\\\"; rg -n \\\"D-01|backtick|mention\\\" specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/goal.md | head -10\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":179