{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794848819692,"sessionID":"ses_e1abf3e72ffecbrpVf6MWZonWP","part":{"partID":"prt_1e553851f001iJTfas8gSkwUp5","sessionID":"ses_e1abf3e72ffecbrpVf6MWZonWP","messageID":"msg_1e55360f6001627uxQKufngKhz","type":"tool","id":"call_ad619a2838ee4e0ebd2e4c08","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"rg -n \"STUCK_RECOVERY|stuckRecovery|stuckThresholdReached\" .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/convergence.cjs | head -20; echo \"---YAML---\"; rg -n \"STUCK_RECOVERY|stuckRecovery\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml | head -20; echo \"---PROTOCOL---\"; rg -n \"stuckRecovery|STUCK_RECOVERY\" .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references -g '*.md' | head -20","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research"},"output":"12:// maxIterationsReached, consecutiveFailures, stuckThresholdReached,\n1131:    return emit('STUCK_RECOVERY', 'stuckRecovery', 'stuckThresholdReached', gatesAt(false), []);\n1313:    if ((row.type === 'event' && row.event === 'stuckRecovery')\n---YAML---\n1025:          2. if stuck_count >= config.stuckThreshold: STUCK_RECOVERY\n1067:          - decision: \"STOP | BLOCKED | STUCK_RECOVERY | CONTINUE\"\n1101:          - recovery_strategy: \"One-line hint describing the next review action when decision == BLOCKED or STUCK_RECOVERY\"\n1143:              terminal_stop_reason = reason when it is maxIterationsReached, maxDurationReached, manualStop or error, else \"converged\". Read reason, never stopReason: every manual stop sets reason to manualStop while stopReason may still hold blockedStop or stuckRecovery\n1155:              excluded_reasons: [maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused, maxDurationReached]\n1325:            pending_stop_reason: \"stuckRecovery\"\n1331:        action: \"Rewrite raw pause and recovery events to the frozen STOP_REASONS enum at emission time: converged, maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused, maxDurationReached\"\n1343:          append_jsonl: '{\"stem\":\"deep_review.recovery_started\",\"scope\":{\"runId\":\"{session_id}\",\"sessionId\":\"{session_id}\",\"generation\":{generation},\"iterationId\":\"iteration-{current_iteration}\",\"dimensionId\":\"{least_explored}\"},\"data\":{\"normalizedStopReason\":\"stuckRecovery\",\"recoveryCause\":\"repeated-no-progress\",\"fromIterationId\":\"iteration-{current_iteration}\",\"strategy\":\"{recovery_strategy_code}\",\"targetDimensionId\":\"{least_explored}\",\"outcome\":\"recovery-started\",\"lineageRef\":\"{session_id}\",\"priorTailDigest\":\"{prior_tail_digest}\",\"originatingPauseEventId\":\"none\"}}'\n1858:          - reason: \"Use the latest stop reason if present: read stopReason from the last line of {state_paths.state_log} with type === 'event' and event === 'terminal_gates' when it is newer than the latest stop event, since a manual stop is stored only there; else the frozen default 'converged'. (Must be a member of the STOP_REASONS enum: converged, maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused, maxDurationReached.)\"\n---PROTOCOL---\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/protocol/loop-state-and-gates.md:55:    |-- stuck_count >= 2 --> [STUCK_RECOVERY]\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/protocol/loop-state-and-gates.md:59:[STUCK_RECOVERY] --> change granularity / protocol replay / escalate severity\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/convergence/convergence.md:31:| **STUCK_RECOVERY** | No progress detected for consecutive iterations. Attempt a recovery strategy before deciding. |\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/convergence/convergence.md:105:Review has one eligible reason: the exact internal reason `all_dimensions_clean` with decision `STOP`. The nine legal-stop gates run before the divergent branch and remain unchanged. `maxIterationsReached`, `blockedStop`, `stuckRecovery`, `error`, `manualStop`, `userPaused` and `maxDurationReached` are explicitly excluded. Max iterations, pause or cancellation, manual stop, unrecoverable error, a reached duration limit and any blocked security or quality gate therefore never dispatch a pivot Council.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/convergence/convergence.md:121:| `stuckRecovery` | Stuck detection triggered recovery. |\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/convergence/convergence.md:230:The recovery entry uses `stopReason=stuckRecovery` while the loop is in recovery. If recovery later terminates the run, the terminal record keeps the same shared enum value instead of minting a review-only label.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/convergence/convergence.md:531:| `stuck_detected` | `stuckRecovery` | Legacy recovery trigger label. |\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/convergence/convergence.md:532:| `stuck_unrecoverable` | `stuckRecovery` | Legacy terminal wording for the same recovery path family. |\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/protocol/loop-protocol.md:183:- Stuck count `>= 2` using `noProgressThreshold = 0.05`? `STUCK_RECOVERY`\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/protocol/loop-protocol.md:229:Normalization rule: if the runtime first observes a raw `paused` condition or a raw `stuck_recovery` condition, it MUST rewrite the emitted JSONL event names to `userPaused` and `stuckRecovery` before appending them. Persisted review JSONL should never contain raw `paused` or raw `stuck_recovery` rows after emission.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/protocol/loop-protocol.md:420:- If STUCK_RECOVERY: apply review-specific recovery strategies (see Section 3a), reset stuck count, continue\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:266:`converged`, `maxIterationsReached`, `blockedStop`, `stuckRecovery`, `error`, `manualStop`, `userPaused`, `maxDurationReached`\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:286:  \"event\": \"stuckRecovery\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:288:  \"stopReason\": \"stuckRecovery\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:300:**Emission rule:** If runtime logic first identifies a raw `paused` or `stuck_recovery` condition, the workflow MUST normalize it to `userPaused` or `stuckRecovery` before writing the JSONL line. Reducers and dashboards may assume persisted event names are already normalized.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/convergence/convergence-recovery.md:121:Stop reason: [converged | maxIterationsReached | userPaused | blockedStop | stuckRecovery | error | manualStop | maxDurationReached]\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/convergence/convergence-recovery.md:186:  \"stuckRecoveryAttempts\": 0\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"12:// maxIterationsReached, consecutiveFailures, stuckThresholdReached,\n1131:    return emit('STUCK_RECOVERY', 'stuckRecovery', 'stuckThresholdReached', gatesAt(false), []);\n1313:    if ((row.type === 'event' && row.event === 'stuckRecovery')\n---YAML---\n1025:          2. if stuck_count >= config.stuckThreshold: STUCK_RECOVERY\n1067:          - decision: \"STOP | BLOCKED | STUCK_RECOVERY | CONTINUE\"\n1101:          - recovery_strategy: \"One-line hint describing the next review action when decision == BLOCKED or STUCK_RECOVERY\"\n1143:              terminal_stop_reason = reason when it is maxIterationsReached, maxDurationReached, manualStop or error, else \"converged\". Read reason, never stopReason: every manual stop sets reason to manualStop while stopReason may still hold blockedStop or stuckRecovery\n1155:              excluded_reasons: [maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused, maxDurationReached]\n1325:            pending_stop_reason: \"stuckRecovery\"\n1331:        action: \"Rewrite raw pause and recovery events to the frozen STOP_REASONS enum at emission time: converged, maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused, maxDurationReached\"\n1343:          append_jsonl: '{\"stem\":\"deep_review.recovery_started\",\"scope\":{\"runId\":\"{session_id}\",\"sessionId\":\"{session_id}\",\"generation\":{generation},\"iterationId\":\"iteration-{current_iteration}\",\"dimensionId\":\"{least_explored}\"},\"data\":{\"normalizedStopReason\":\"stuckRecovery\",\"recoveryCause\":\"repeated-no-progress\",\"fromIterationId\":\"iteration-{current_iteration}\",\"strategy\":\"{recovery_strategy_code}\",\"targetDimensionId\":\"{least_explored}\",\"outcome\":\"recovery-started\",\"lineageRef\":\"{session_id}\",\"priorTailDigest\":\"{prior_tail_digest}\",\"originatingPauseEventId\":\"none\"}}'\n1858:          - reason: \"Use the latest stop reason if present: read stopReason from the last line of {state_paths.state_log} with type === 'event' and event === 'terminal_gates' when it is newer than the latest stop event, since a manual stop is stored only there; else the frozen default 'converged'. (Must be a member of the STOP_REASONS enum: converged, maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused, maxDurationReached.)\"\n---PROTOCOL---\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/protocol/loop-state-and-gates.md:55:    |-- stuck_count >= 2 --> [STUCK_RECOVERY]\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/protocol/loop-state-and-gates.md:59:[STUCK_RECOVERY] --> change granularity / protocol replay / escalate severity\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/convergence/convergence.md:31:| **STUCK_RECOVERY** | No progress detected for consecutive iterations. At